  "message_id": "MSG_033",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 24 01 0B 01 04 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 25 01}比起独处，人多一些，\n也更容易产生新想法。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e801_120.bf.json:33:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_034",
